      "items": ["900700"],
      "text": "A quotation and the earliest available sailing were requested for the usual CitrusLiftKitchenSpray order to the UK.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [1]}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "items": ["900700"],
      "text": "The supplier requested adding newly launched GleamNestSinkFoam to the CitrusLiftKitchenSpray order and stated that customers supporting the launch receive preference when production slots are allocated. No separate dispatch date was confirmed for CitrusLiftKitchenSpray.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [2]}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "items": [],
      "text": "Purchasing requested confirmation that established-range orders could proceed without a launch purchase, and requested UK labelling information, carton quantities and pricing for GleamNestSinkFoam without committing to buy it.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [3]}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "items": ["900701"],
      "text": "The supplier confirmed that PureFoldLaundrySheets remained available to order separately at the quoted price. Purchasing requested written confirmation of the production date before issuing the purchase order.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [4]}
    }
  ],
  "supplier_lead_time": null,
  "lead_time_changes": [],
  "quantity_changes": [],
  "figures_after_changes": [],
  "stock_findings": [],
  "critical_questions": [
    {
      "question": "Can CitrusLiftKitchenSpray be ordered without GleamNestSinkFoam, and what production slot, dispatch date and UK sailing would apply without a launch purchase?",
      "ask": "supplier",
      "items": ["900700"],
      "findings": [1, 2, 3]
    },
    {
      "question": "What production date can you confirm in writing for the separate PureFoldLaundrySheets order at the quoted price?",
      "ask": "supplier",
      "items": ["900701"],
      "findings": [4]
    }
  ],
  "recommended_actions": [
    {
      "action": "Before placing the CitrusLiftKitchenSpray order, obtain written confirmation of standalone ordering terms and its production, dispatch and sailing dates. Establish whether launch-related production preference would affect that schedule; do not treat the requested launch addition as an agreed purchase condition.",
      "items": ["900700"],
      "findings": [1, 2, 3]
    },
    {
      "action": "Obtain written confirmation of the PureFoldLaundrySheets production date before issuing its separate purchase order at the quoted price.",
      "items": ["900701"],
      "findings": [4]
    },
    {
      "action": "Before making any commitment to GleamNestSinkFoam, review the requested UK labelling information, carton quantities and pricing separately from the established-range orders.",
      "items": [],
      "findings": [3]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Both items remain Low risk, with no documented basis to change lead times or quantities. Resolve whether launch-related production preference affects standalone CitrusLiftKitchenSpray scheduling before ordering. PureFoldLaundrySheets is confirmed available separately at the quoted price, but its production date still requires written confirmation. Keep any launch-product commitment separate and subject to review of UK labelling, carton quantities and pricing."
}

{
