      "action": "Immediately follow up the RoastedGimSeaweed quotation and obtain written confirmation of order acceptance, production allocation and shipment timing without the launch product, before placing the order by 2026-03-20. If the supplier cannot commit in time, assess alternative supply immediately rather than allowing launch negotiations to delay the order.",
