      "items": ["900101"],
      "findings": [5]
    },
    {
      "action": "Place the HoneyButterRicePuffs order immediately on 2026-03-02 and arrange expedited shipping, an earlier partial delivery or alternative-source cover to bridge its 3-week gap. Obtain a firm production slot and dispatch commitment independently of the launch purchase alongside order placement, without delaying the order.",
      "items": ["900100"],
      "findings": [2, 3, 4]
    },
    {
      "action": "Keep the YujaCreamWaferRolls assessment separate from the urgent HoneyButterRicePuffs order. Complete the requested UK labelling, case-pricing and sample assessment before making any launch purchase commitment.",
