{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "items": [],
      "text": "Lumae manufactures kitchenware and household storage products in Korea. Export quotations are in US dollars, and orders are consolidated for shipment to the UK.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [1]}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "items": ["900300", "900302"],
      "text": "Prices and production dates were requested for a repeat order of BoriSealRiceKeeper and DaroStackPantryBoxes, using the established specifications without additional lines.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [2]}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "items": ["900300"],
      "text": "Alongside the BoriSealRiceKeeper repeat-order quotation, Lumae proposed its newly launched MisoDryUtensilPod and stated that buyers supporting the launch would receive first consideration when BoriSealRiceKeeper production slots were allocated.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [3]}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "items": ["900300"],
      "text": "Lumae was asked to confirm a BoriSealRiceKeeper production slot independently of any launch purchase. A separate quotation and samples for MisoDryUtensilPod were requested without an order commitment.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [4]}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "items": ["900301"],
      "text": "During a repeat-quotation call for NamuNestPrepBowls, Lumae recommended including MisoDryUtensilPod in the same shipment. No link to production allocation or dispatch priority was mentioned.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [5]}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "items": ["900303"],
      "text": "Future SoraFoldDishRack purchase orders must retain the approved hinge-cycle and carton drop-test requirements regardless of source. Any proposed folding-mechanism change requires sample approval before production.",
      "basis": {"stock": false, "documents": [6]}
    }
  ],
  "supplier_lead_time": null,
  "lead_time_changes": [],
  "quantity_changes": [],
  "figures_after_changes": [],
  "stock_findings": [
    {
      "id": 7,
      "items": ["900303"],
      "text": "SoraFoldDishRack is Critical, with 10.6 weeks to stockout and an expected stockout gap of 7.4 weeks at the 18-week lead time. Its latest order date is 2026-03-02, marked overdue, and its latest delivery date is 2026-05-15.",
      "basis": {"stock": true, "documents": []}
    }
  ],
  "critical_questions": [
    {
      "question": "What expedited shipping or early partial delivery can you offer for SoraFoldDishRack, with delivery by 2026-05-15?",
      "ask": "supplier",
      "items": ["900303"],
      "findings": [7]
    },
    {
      "question": "Can you confirm a BoriSealRiceKeeper production slot and delivery commitment independently of a MisoDryUtensilPod purchase, and explain whether launch-related allocation priority would affect this repeat order?",
      "ask": "supplier",
      "items": ["900300"],
      "findings": [3, 4]
    }
  ],
  "recommended_actions": [
    {
      "action": "Place the SoraFoldDishRack order immediately. In parallel, arrange expedited shipping, an early partial delivery or alternative-source supply to bridge the 7.4-week gap; do not delay this cover while waiting to consolidate other lines.",
      "items": ["900303"],
      "findings": [1, 7]
    },
    {
      "action": "Include the approved hinge-cycle and carton drop-test requirements when issuing the immediate SoraFoldDishRack purchase order and any alternative-source order. Require sample approval before production if a folding-mechanism change is proposed.",
      "items": ["900303"],
      "findings": [6, 7]
    },
    {
      "action": "Obtain written confirmation of independent BoriSealRiceKeeper production allocation before placing its repeat order, allowing time to resolve any restriction before the latest order date of 2026-12-28. Keep any launch-product evaluation separate from the repeat-order commitment.",
      "items": ["900300"],
      "findings": [2, 3, 4]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "SoraFoldDishRack is Critical with a 7.4-week gap; order immediately and arrange expedited, partial or alternative-source cover while retaining the required quality controls. Lumae linked BoriSealRiceKeeper production-slot priority to launch support, so secure an independent allocation commitment before its repeat order. The NamuNestPrepBowls launch recommendation carried no stated allocation or dispatch condition. The documents do not establish a lead-time change or a UK-demand basis for changing quantities."
}

